# THIS REPO EXISTS SO THE CORPUS HAS A REMOTE WITHOUT MOVING.
# 2026-09-20: memory-bake-off/team held 3,706 files of research output with no
# remote at all, and every row on the board declares an ABSOLUTE path into it.
# Moving the corpus into implementer/repo/team would have been structurally
# tidier and would have broken ~983 declared paths at once. So the directory
# stays where it is and gets its own checkout of the project repo instead.
#
# The branch is fleet/team-corpus and it is an ORPHAN: nothing from main is
# ever checked out here, because a checkout would overwrite the live corpus.

# The real checkout of this same repo, nested inside this directory.
implementer/

# Upstream datasets we fetched, not results we produced - 65 MB of the 127.
team/S7-KD-WORLDS/upstream/
team/builder-provenance-fetches/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
